[84.422272, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b7\u001b[2;77H\u001b[38;5;210m\u2584\u001b[38;5;210m\u2580\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588\u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;216m\u2584\u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;222m\u2588\u001b[38;5;222m\u2580\u001b[0m\u001b[3;77H\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588\u001b[38;5;210m\u2580\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2580 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;222m\u2584\u001b[38;5;222m\u2588\u001b[38;5;222m\u2584\u001b[0m\u001b[4;77H\u001b]8;;https://www.superinference.org\u0007\u001b[2mwww.superinference.org\u001b[22m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[0m\u001b8\u001b[29A\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[K## Usage\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[K| Command | Effect |\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K|---------|--------|\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K| `tinycount FILE` | Count lines, words, and characters in FILE |\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K| `tinycount FILE1 FILE2 ...` | Count multiple files and show totals |\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K| `tinycount --lines FILE` | Show line count only |\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K| `tinycount --words FILE` | Show word count only |\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K| `tinycount --chars FILE` | Show character count only |\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K| `tinycount --help` | Display help and exit |\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K| `tinycount --version` | Display version and exit |\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K## Details\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[K| Aspect | Behavior |\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K|--------|----------|\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K| **What is counted** | Lines: newlines. Words: space-separated tokens. Characters: bytes (including\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K whitespace). |\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K| **Empty\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b7\u001b[2;77H\u001b[38;5;210m\u2584\u001b[38;5;210m\u2580\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588\u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;216m\u2584\u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;