[86.065615, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b7\u001b[2;77H\u001b[38;5;210m\u2584\u001b[38;5;210m\u2580\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588\u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;216m\u2584\u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;222m\u2588\u001b[38;5;222m\u2580\u001b[0m\u001b[3;77H\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588\u001b[38;5;210m\u2580\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2580 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;222m\u2584\u001b[38;5;222m\u2588\u001b[38;5;222m\u2584\u001b[0m\u001b[4;77H\u001b]8;;https://www.superinference.org\u0007\u001b[2mwww.superinference.org\u001b[22m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[0m\u001b8\u001b[29A\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[K| Aspect | Behavior |\r\r\n\u001b[2G\u001b[K--------|----------|\r\r\n\u001b[2G\u001b[K **What is counted** | Lines: newlines. Words: space-separated tokens. Characters: bytes (including\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K whitespace). |\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K| **Empty files** | Display all counts as zero; always succeeds. |\r\r\n\u001b[5G\u001b[KMultiple files** | Shows per-file results, then a total row. |\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[Kissing files** | Reports an error and exits with status 1; continues other files. |\r\r\n\u001b[5G\u001b[Kstdin** | Use `-` as filename or pipe: `cat file.txt \\| tinycount -` |\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K## Examples\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KCount a single file:\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K```bash\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K$ tinycount poem.txt\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kpoem.txt: 12 lines, 84 words, 512 characters\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KCount multiple files with totals:\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K$ tinycount *.md\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KREADME.md: 45 lines, 320 words, 2100 characters\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KGUIDE.md: 30 lines, 210\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b7\u001b[2;77H\u001b[38;5;210m\u2584\u001b[38;5;210m\u2580\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588\u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;2